** State registry
One invocation of =biomechanical-input-interface-define-state= both defines the
mode/keymap AND registers the state here — a state file is one unit,
never invocation-plus-separate-push. Order in this alist is newest
eval first (push); =init-state-fn= consults colliding states via an
explicit precedence list, not position, so alphabetical file order
can never silently reorder decisions.
